This directory contains historic AmigaPython material that is not used by
the current AmigaPython 2.7.18 build (old library wrappers, ConvertFD, etc.).

Live equivalents:
  amigalibsmodule.c / asm  -> Modules/amiga/amigalibsmodule.c +
                              Amiga/amigalibs_calllib.asm
  ConvertFD.py             -> Tools/ConvertFD.py
  intuitionlib.py          -> Lib/site-python/intuitionlib.py
  (simplegfx)              -> Modules/amiga/amigaguimodule.c (amigagui)

Kept for reference only.  Do not add these unused/ sources to the active
Modules build without review.
